summary: Leap second general hrtimer testing
description: |
    This test is ensuring leap second functionality works as expected with the high resolution timers.
    Test Inputs:
        check_hrtimer_exprie_ontime.c, hrtimer.c, and leap_second.c is source that is compiled and enables testing
        and validation of this case.
    Expected results:
            * Hrtimer Expire Testing start -> PASS
        kernel no livelock panic
        + rstrnt-report-result general/time/leap-second/leap_hrtimer PASS 0
    Results location:
        output.txt
contact: Qiao Zhao <qzhao@redhat.com>
id: e1ffd3a2-11eb-4c53-abfc-063efcbbb4c7
test: bash -x ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - gcc
  - make
  - psmisc
  - type: file
    pattern:
        - /cki_lib
duration: 3h
tier: 1
extra-summary: general/time/leap-second/leap_hrtimer
